{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"cd3705dfdd229e315f55bc857b7e919b9063503e244fa20796a6f007d1ea3954","ja":"セレブの誇り","zh":"名媛的骄傲","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0e82967ba79cca30c4a2062a97879a22d97065d4c313cd58e6f1cb8fe29d63b9","ja":"千鶴ちゃん、今度クイズ番組に出るんですってね♪\nそれもセレブ枠で！","zh":"千鹤，听说你下次要上问答节目了呢♪\n而且还是名流嘉宾！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"29491dd38d1bdb33e74e46156c7a0106e64ab36ed6fcf1992121f321bc3ff628","ja":"ええ！　スタッフさんがナイトプールでのわたくしの\n振る舞いを気に入ってくださったとかで♪","zh":"是的！据说是因为工作人员很中意\n我在夜间泳池的表现呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a09bc55f2efb6224f86c95d26612931e5229096918f1fe154dc1848d933a0989","ja":"そのご期待に\nしっかりとお応えしないといけませんわね！","zh":"必须好好回应\n大家的这份期待呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2f503a2badd899d68f0b780d344538a5cfc5c1f577a96c23e8b8dd23ca838c5a","ja":"クイズのお題は『高級ワイン』なのよね？\nそれなら大丈夫よ。千鶴ちゃん、詳しいんでしょう？","zh":"问答题的题目是“高级红酒”对吧？\n那肯定没问题的。千鹤，你很懂这些的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"99ce1742fefda3642302b84ae87513da3165fb339592297d0f564e33abdae27c","ja":"……も、もちろんですわ！　セレブとして、\nこれまで様々なワインに親しんできましたもの。","zh":"……当、当然了！身为主流名媛，\n我向来品尝过各种各样的葡萄酒呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a87dd60f8bc1d1fe23bf119b823d47d4b899be9cad5bf6185130f1542db77efc","ja":"必ずやパーフェクトで優勝してみせましてよ！\nおーほっほっほ！","zh":"我一定会以完美表现夺冠给您看的！\n哦——呵呵呵！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2a5fbc27eec65462ee5d01c0908b447511d027dd7dcb266b22e773c67871242a","ja":"……ゲホッ、ゴホッ。","zh":"……咳咳，咳咳。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8527f5a169ef43c42c64e2d121a6b38e753cfaba5e1dde839095c12dcc91fdd0","ja":"（はぁ……番組の収録までに、\nなんとか高級ワインの知識を身につけないと……！）","zh":"（唉……在节目收录之前，\n必须得想办法掌握高级红酒的知识才行……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4f45792d356febe41fc02732040a4fca983c60834e22c521653fdeb69e3f834f","ja":"（試しに、こちらのお店に入ってみようかしら。\n少し飲み比べるくらいなら……）","zh":"（要不试着进这家店看看吧。\n只是稍微品尝对比一下的话……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c3a61b378b8f6b94d21daf0e39f979671ce7550b172d8a2df79790b05855cf14","ja":"（なっ！？　グラスでこのお値段！？\n高級ワイン……想像以上ですわ！）","zh":"（什、什么！？单杯就要这个价格吗！？\n高档葡萄酒……真是超出想象了！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"480987a7fe0301615b9d5b0fb57155673ea7fd2c1a67af4fb4bac9e3469a7936","ja":"……あら？　千鶴ちゃん？","zh":"……哎呀？是千鹤吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1269.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"42bec671e90418547378c49475b4d3516c2c3b15cb8b1fb41f1a146e46c95e8e","ja":"えっ！　あ、あずさ！？\nどうしてこちらに！？","zh":"诶！梓、梓小姐！？\n你怎么会在这里！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
